  primaryClass={math.CO},
  note={Submitted May 2023; published Sep 2024. Introduces the "Spectre"
    tile: a chiral aperiodic monotile that tiles the plane using only
    translations and rotations (no reflections needed), unlike the "hat"
    tile of the companion paper SmithMyersKaplanGoodmanStrauss2023Hat. This
    is the actual geometric source for
    \texttt{include/ravel/spectre\_geometry.hpp}'s vertex coordinates,
    substitution rule table, and supertile assembly recipe, and for
    \texttt{python/spectre*.py}. Previously cited only by author-and-year in
    source comments and in \texttt{docs/FINDINGS\_FOR\_CITATION.md}, without
    a bibliography entry, archived full text, or disambiguation from the hat
    paper -- corrected 2026-08-07. Local preservation: PDF/TXT recorded in
    \texttt{refs/FULLTEXT\_MANIFEST.tsv}, full text kept in
    \texttt{refs/FullText/smith\_myers\_kaplan\_goodmanstrauss\_2023\_spectre\_
    2305.17743.\{pdf,txt\}}.}
}

